WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.855
Lash appointment coming up? Three small things before your visit decide how long your lashes last!

2
00:00:05.855 --> 00:00:11.353
Skip the mascara, don't drink lots of coffee, and don't apply oily eye cream.

3
00:00:11.353 --> 00:00:15.261
First: don't wear mascara or eyeliner to your appointment.

4
00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:19.985
Mascara stops the glue from bonding, and cleaning it off takes time.

5
00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:23.976
Second: don't drink lots of coffee right before your visit.

6
00:00:23.976 --> 00:00:29.558
Lying still for about 90 minutes is hard when you're restless and your eyes keep blinking.

7
00:00:29.558 --> 00:00:34.086
Third: don't apply oily eye cream or oil around your eyes.

8
00:00:34.086 --> 00:00:38.664
Oil on the lashes weakens the bond, and extensions fall out early.

9
00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:44.930
So what should you do? Take out your contact lenses, use the bathroom first, and bring headphones.

10
00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:49.198
Then just lie back and relax. Many clients even fall asleep.

11
00:00:49.198 --> 00:00:55.380
In short: no mascara, not much coffee, no oily eye cream, and come relaxed.

12
00:00:55.380 --> 00:01:00.494
Ready? Moja Beauty is waiting for you in Kamppi, Hakaniemi and Sörnäinen!

13
00:01:00.494 --> 00:01:06.987
Book Moja Beauty in seconds on VaraaAi: pick a service, pick a time, done!
